Z||000004||terryk||10-03-2000||11:26 AM||||There is no reason the 749 and Sunbird GT Turbo code couldn't be used to run a turbo Duke with HEI. It won't work with a DIS Duke. <P>The Syclone and Sunbird code is the same, but with differences for the number of cylinders and the displacement difference.<P>A bit-o-tweaking on the Sunbird calibrations and it would work fine. The Sunbird would just be closer to start.||||reg||1
